# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=spirv-llvm-translator
_lockname=spirv-llvm-translator
pkgver=20.1.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Translates between LLVM and SPIR-V (for Mesa's OpenCL C shader kernels)"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-LLVM-Translator"
license=(NCSA)
depends=(llvm spirv-tools)
source=("https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-LLVM-Translator/archive/v$pkgver/SPIRV-LLVM-Translator-$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('ffca6b2aa53076ef85a09676ef0079877cce4977d7aa64f5f5b33596c7d1d285')

build() {
    cmake -S SPIRV-LLVM-Translator-$pkgver -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \
        -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DLLVM_DIR=/usr/lib/cmake/llvm -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON \
        -DLLVM_EXTERNAL_SPIRV_HEADERS_SOURCE_DIR=/usr -DLLVM_SPIRV_INCLUDE_TESTS=OFF
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
